    "media:imagetext": "Take-off \u0026 Landing\nTERRE\nStart und landung\nDécollage et atterissage\nAl salir y aterrizar\nBefore opening an exit,\nquickly look through a\nwindow to check outside\nfor the following:\nSmoke\nIf smoke is so thick you can not see out,\ndirect passengers to other exits.\nFire\nIf there is fire outside the aircraft,\ndirect passengers to other exits.\nDebris/\nObstructions\nIf there is metal debris or obstructions,\ndirect passengers to other exits.\nEmergency exits\n**0\n·3w0\n871 47\nNotausgang\nSorties de secours\nSalidas de emergencia\nA\nB\nA\nDirect passengers\naway from aircraft.\nNo smoking\nNicht rauchen\nDéfense de fumer\nNo fumar\nA\nEXIT\nExit\n#*0\nHO\nAusgang\nSortie\nSalida\nB\n2\n2\nOxygen\nsauerstoff\nOxygène\nOxigeno\nCheck that the slide has properly\ninflated and is in good condition.\nUse handles to stabilize slide.\n1.....P",
